<div class="workspace" aria-label="Illustrative Sellora catalog workspace">
  <aside class="workspace-sidebar" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="wordmark">sellora<span>✳</span></span>
    <div class="demo-store"><span class="store-monogram">S</span><span>Studio collection<small>Example store</small></span></div>
    <div class="workspace-nav"><span>◫ &nbsp; Overview</span><span class="selected">▤ &nbsp; Catalog health <b>04</b></span><span>↗ &nbsp; Sales signals</span><span>☷ &nbsp; Recommendations</span></div>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="status-dot"></span> Your team stays in control</div>
  </aside>
  <div class="workspace-main">
    <div class="workspace-topline"><span>Workspace <span class="slash">/</span> Catalog health</span><span class="demo-label">ILLUSTRATIVE DEMO</span></div>
    <div class="workspace-heading"><div><h2>A little attention. A better catalog.</h2><p>The details worth a second look.</p></div><span class="round-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
    <div class="workspace-stats"><div><span>Products reviewed</span><strong>128</strong></div><div><span>Findings to review</span><strong>04 <small>Needs attention</small></strong></div><div><span>Team approved</span><strong>00 <small>You're in control</small></strong></div></div>
    <div class="workspace-findings">
      <div class="finding-list"><div class="table-label"><span>FINDING</span><span>PRIORITY</span></div>
        <div class="finding-row is-highlighted"><span class="finding-number">01</span><div><strong>Missing size measurements</strong><span>Everyday linen kurta · Ivory</span></div><span class="severity">Review</span></div>
        <div class="finding-row"><span class="finding-number">02</span><div><strong>Product details don't match</strong><span>Two-piece set · Product description</span></div><span class="severity neutral">Review</span></div>
        <div class="finding-row"><span class="finding-number">03</span><div><strong>Sale price needs checking</strong><span>Summer edit · Offer accuracy</span></div><span class="severity neutral">Review</span></div>
        <div class="finding-row"><span class="finding-number">04</span><div><strong>Promoted, but most sizes are out</strong><span>Everyday collection · Availability</span></div><span class="severity neutral">Review</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="product-peek"><%= image_tag "linen-kurta.webp", alt: "Illustrative ivory linen kurta on a wooden hanger", width: 960, height: 1280, fetchpriority: "high" %><div><span class="micro">THE EVERYDAY EDIT</span><strong>Good products.<br> Details that matter.</strong></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="workspace-foot"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> Recommendations first. Changes only after review.</span><span>Fictional store &amp; data</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
